      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Teacher madam! In such a huge estate palace there is no asafoetida? You come and tell the secretary there is no asafoetida, no tamarind.... Tell the cooks!...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "This reply exploits the Tamil homonym/pun `பெருங்காயம்` (serious wound / asafoetida)."
